[h1]Galactic Active Pause[/h1]
Press [b]PAUSE[/b] on the galactic map to pause, and press it again to resume. While you have the game paused, you can still give orders.

[h2]Features[/h2]
[list]
[*]Pause and resume galactic time with a single key. The on-screen Pause/Play button stays in sync.
[*][b]Rebindable in the game:[/b] Options > Keyboard > Interface > Pause/Play. The default is the Pause key, because Space is the game's Battle Cam key.
[*][b]Orders while paused:[/b] move fleets, queue production on planets, and move troops between the surface and orbit. Nothing moves or builds until you unpause.
[*]The 'Game Paused' banner appears instantly instead of sliding in.
[*]Tactical battles are not affected.
[*]Works with data mods such as AotR and Thrawn's Revenge, including Workshop mods.
[/list]

[h2]IMPORTANT: one-time install step[/h2]
This is a small code mod (a DLL). Steam cannot put it in the game folder for you, so subscribing alone is not enough:
[olist]
[*]Subscribe, and wait for Steam to download the item.
[*]In Steam, right-click the game > Manage > Browse local files. Go up two folders to [i]steamapps[/i], then open [i]workshop > content > 32470 > (this item's ID number)[/i].
[*]Double-click [b]Install.bat[/b]. It finds the game automatically.
[*]Start Forces of Corruption normally. You don't need to launch this item as a mod.
[/olist]
To uninstall, run [b]Uninstall.bat[/b] from the same folder. Updating from an older version: run Install.bat again after Steam downloads the update.

[h2]Compatibility[/h2]
[list]
[*]Requires the current Steam 64-bit release of Forces of Corruption (2024 patch).
[*]If a future game update changes the executable, the mod turns itself off safely. The game then runs normally until the mod is updated.
[*]If another mod ships its own keyboard-options layout, the Pause/Play row is missing from that options screen, but the key still works.
[*]Single player only. The game does not allow galactic pausing in multiplayer.
[/list]

[h2]Settings[/h2]
To turn off orders while paused, rename [i]SpaceBarPause.ini.example[/i] to [i]SpaceBarPause.ini[/i] and put it in the game's [i]corruption[/i] folder.

[h2]Source code & manual download[/h2]
Open source (MIT): [url=https://github.com/nandusmasta/swfoc-galactic-active-pause]github.com/nandusmasta/swfoc-galactic-active-pause[/url]
Some antivirus programs flag DLL mods that change the game's code in memory. You can read and build the full source yourself.

[h2]Changelog[/h2]
[b]v1.1.0[/b]
[list]
[*]Renamed from Space Bar Pause to Galactic Active Pause.
[*]The pause key is now Pause by default, rebindable in Options > Keyboard > Interface > Pause/Play. Space is left to the game's Battle Cam.
[*]The 'Game Paused' banner appears instantly instead of sliding in.
[/list]
[b]v1.0.0[/b]
[list]
[*]First release: Space pauses the galactic map, and orders still work while paused.
[/list]

